  "Support &amp; Contact": "支持与联系",
  "Enterprise-grade hotel software starting at just $55/month. Cloud PMS and real-time channel manager with no setup fee.": "企业级酒店软件，每月仅需 55 美元起。云端 PMS 与实时渠道管理器，无设置费。",
  "A direct-booking website starting at just $380. Fast, mobile-optimized, SEO-ready websites designed to convert visitors into direct bookings.": "直客预订网站，仅需 380 美元起。快速、移动端优化、符合 SEO 的网站设计，旨在将访客转化为直接预订。",
  "Professional social media management, content creation, and paid Meta Ads starting at $299/month. We turn your social presence into a true booking channel.": "专业社交媒体管理、内容创作及 Meta 付费广告，每月 299 美元起。我们将您的社交形象转化为真正的预订渠道。",
  "Based in Bangkok, with on-ground teams and local expertise across Thailand, Laos, India, Nepal, Malaysia, and Vietnam.": "总部位于曼谷，在泰国、老挝、印度、尼泊尔、马来西亚和越南均设有落地团队并具备本地专业知识。",
  "A full-time in-house revenue manager typically costs significantly more in salary alone, before software, training, or turnover risk. CRS Central gives you the same (often higher) level of expertise, backed by a full team instead of one person, at a fraction of the cost — with no recruitment, no training period, and no gap in coverage if someone leaves.": "通常情况下，一位全职内部收益经理仅薪资成本就高得多，更不用提软件、培训或人员流失风险。CRS Central 以极低的成本为您提供相同（通常更高）水平的专业服务，并由整个团队而非单人提供支持——无需招聘，无需培训期，也不用担心员工离职导致的空窗期。",
  "Our comprehensive service includes:": "我们的全方位服务包括：",
  "Our pricing starts from USD 300 per month and goes up to USD 2,800 per month. The final price depends entirely on the number of rooms in your hotel. There are no hidden costs, no commissions, and no additional taxes—just one flat, transparent fee.": "我们的定价从每月 300 美元到 2,800 美元不等。最终价格完全取决于您酒店的客房数量。无隐藏费用、无佣金、无额外税费——只有一项固定且透明的费用。",
  "No. Our pricing is a single flat monthly fee with no commission on your bookings or revenue, no setup fees, and no hidden costs.": "不。我们的定价为单一固定月费，对您的预订或收益不收取任何佣金，无设置费，也无隐藏费用。",
  "Our Property Management System (PMS) and Channel Manager services start at USD 55 per month.": "我们的物业管理系统 (PMS) 和渠道管理器服务每月 55 美元起。",
  "Website development starts at a one-time charge of USD 380. All you need to do is provide high-quality photos and descriptions of your services, and we will build a fully functional website for your hotel.": "网站开发起价为一次性费用 380 美元。您只需提供高质量的照片和服务描述，我们就会为您的酒店搭建一个功能齐全的网站。",
  "Our digital marketing service starts from USD 299/month, covering 15 posts, 2 videos, and weekly Meta Ads setup across Instagram, Facebook &amp; YouTube. Higher-volume content plans or additional platforms are available at a custom rate.": "我们的数字营销服务每月 299 美元起，包含 15 篇帖子、2 个视频以及在 Instagram、Facebook 和 YouTube 每周进行 Meta 广告设置。如需更高数量的内容计划或其他平台，可提供定制报价。",
  "Yes — most hotels combine two or more services since they work best together (e.g., Revenue Management + PMS keeps pricing and inventory perfectly in sync). Bundled pricing is available — ask your revenue audit specialist for a combined quote.": "是的——大多数酒店会结合两项或多项服务，因为它们能产生最佳协同效应（例如，收益管理 + PMS 可保持定价和库存的完美同步）。提供打包定价——请向您的收益审计专家咨询组合报价。",
  "Based on the contract, you can cancel services by providing a minimum of thirty (30) days' prior written notice.": "根据合同规定，您只需至少提前三十 (30) 天发出书面通知即可取消服务。",
