  "English": "中文",
  "3. PMS, Channel Manager &amp; Booking Engine – Enterprise-Grade Hotel Software at an Independent-Hotel Price": "3. PMS、渠道管理器与预订引擎 —— 价格亲民的企业级酒店软件",
  "6. Reservations Management – Precision, Efficiency, and a Seamless Guest Experience": "6. 预订管理 —— 精准、高效及无缝宾客体验",
  "7. Centralized Call Handling – Professional, Brand-Aligned, and Always Available": "7. 集中电话处理 —— 专业、品牌一致且随时在线",
  "8. Guest Support – Extending Your Hospitality Beyond the Front Desk": "8. 宾客支持 —— 将热情好客延伸至前台之外",
  "9. Upselling &amp; Cross-Selling – Maximizing Every Guest Interaction": "9. 向上销售与交叉销售 —— 最大化每一次宾客互动",
  "Running an independent hotel shouldn't mean paying enterprise software fees to keep your rooms synced across booking channels. StayCRS gives you a fully cloud-based Property Management System, Channel Manager, and a direct Booking Engine — the exact category of tools five-star chains rely on.": "经营一家独立酒店不应该意味着要支付企业软件费用来保持跨预订渠道的客房同步。StayCRS 为您提供全云端的物业管理系统、渠道管理器和直接预订引擎——这正是五星级连锁酒店所依赖的一类工具。",
  "Manage reservations, room inventory, rates, and availability from one dashboard. With real-time two-way sync to Booking.com, Agoda, Expedia, Trip.com, and every major OTA, there are no double bookings, no manual rate updates, and no spreadsheets. Plus, steer more guests to your Booking Engine, where you only pay a flat 8% fee instead of 18%.": "通过一个控制面板管理预订、客房库存、房价和空房情况。通过与 Booking.com、Agoda、Expedia、Trip.com 及所有主要 OTA 实时双向同步，不会出现重复预订，无需手动更新房价，也告别电子表格。此外，将更多宾客引导至您的预订引擎，您只需支付 8% 的固定费用，而不是 18%。",
  "Most independent hotels either overpay for enterprise PMS platforms or make do with outdated, disconnected systems. StayCRS closes that gap — professional-grade hotel technology, priced for independent hotels.": "大多数独立酒店要么为企业级 PMS 平台支付过高的费用，要么将就使用过时、不相连的系统。StayCRS 填补了这一空白——为独立酒店量身打造的专业级酒店技术。",
  "Get StayCRS From $110/Month →": "以每月 110 美元起的价格获取 StayCRS →",
  "Cloud PMS: Bookings, check-in/check-out, housekeeping status, and guest folios in one system, accessible from any device.": "云端 PMS：预订、入住/退房、客房清洁状态和宾客账单集中于一个系统中，可通过任何设备访问。",
  "Channel Manager: Real-time rate and availability sync across all connected OTAs — update once, publish everywhere.": "渠道管理器：所有连接的 OTA 的房价和空房情况实时同步——更新一次，随处发布。",
  "Booking Engine: A better channel mix with a direct booking platform taking flat 8% fees.": "预订引擎：通过收取统一 8% 费用的直客预订平台，实现更好的渠道组合。",
  "No Setup Fee: Get live in days, not weeks, with no onboarding cost.": "无设置费：在几天内上线，而不是几周，且无初始设置成本。",
  "No Long-Term Lock-In: Transparent monthly pricing starting at $110/month, scaled to your hotel's size.": "无长期绑定：透明包月定价起价 110 美元/月，并根据酒店规模调整。",
  "Seamless CRS Central Integration: Because we also run your revenue management, your pricing strategy and your booking system stay perfectly in sync.": "与 CRS Central 无缝集成：由于我们也运营您的收益管理，因此您的定价策略和预订系统始终保持完美同步。",
